{"abstract":"With the advent of the retro-gaming movement there is an in-creasing interest in rediscovering games once played. ‘Tip of my Joystick’ is a Reddit community dedicated to the re-finding of for-gotten games. In this subreddit, users describe games they wish to re-find so that other users may help them identify the game’s title. This community thus offers a unique opportunity for studying how players recall and describe games and play experiences of the past. This paper presents the results of an analysis of a random sample of 250 posts from this subreddit. The posts were analyzed in terms of what aspects of games they describe. For the purpose of this analysis we developed a coding scheme consisting of 38 individual codes belonging to 9 different main categories. Our findings may contribute to research on game archiving and collection as they may help inform the design of better game search engines.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Jørgensen, Ida Kathrine Hammeleff","Bogers, Toine"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384862"],"event":{"acronym":"FGD(?)","title":"Foundations of Digital Games"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Re finding","Video games","complex information needs","game archives","game description","known item search"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"kinda like the sims but with ghosts a qualitative analysis of video game re finding requests on reddit","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/85386142/FDG_20_postprint.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-384862","identifier":[{"id":"85092276457","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-f45b62bb-4eae-413f-9c98-3f3fab36907a"],"keyword":["complex information needs","game archives","game description","known-item search","re-finding","video games"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-5-E2762C749EDD3AAF310416A4C6E3175F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/85386142/FDG_20_postprint.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ida Kathrine Hammeleff","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","name":"Jørgensen, Ida Kathrine Hammeleff","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Toine","key":"bogerspau","last":"Bogers","name":"Bogers, Toine","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Georgios N.","key":"yannakakispedh","last":"Yannakakis","name":"Yannakakis, Georgios N.","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Antonios","key":"liapispedh","last":"Liapis","name":"Liapis, Antonios","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Penny","key":"kyburzpedh","last":"Kyburz","name":"Kyburz, Penny","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3402942.3402971","eisbn":["9781450388078"],"pages":"1-4","publisher":"Association for C