{"abstract":"Increasing re-use in Interactive Information Retrieval (IIR) has been an ongoing aim in IIR for a significant amount of time, however progress has been limited and patchy. While re-use of some study aspects can be difficult due to the varied nature of IIR studies, the use of pre- and post-task self-reported measures is widespread and relatively standardised. Nevertheless, re-use of elements in this area is also limited, in part because systems used to implement them are not able to exchange question, instruments, or complete study setups. To address this, this paper presents a standardised, but extendable, format for IIR survey instrument exchange.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Hall, Mark Michael","Bogers, Toine"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-098647"],"event":{"acronym":"CHIIR","end":"2020-03-18","place":"Vancouver, ca","start":"2020-03-14","title":"5th ACM SIGIR Conference on Human Information Interaction and Retrieval, CHIIR 2020","year":"2020"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Hall, Mark Michael"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Open University Milton Keynes"],"keyword":["Data exchange","IIR","Re use","Research Design","Standardisation"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a standardised format for exchanging user study instruments","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-098647","identifier":[{"id":"85082464589","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-a78a4923-bdd6-4327-9824-3bfe81b7de8e"],"keyword":["Data exchange","Iir","Re-use","Research design","Standardisation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-50330E0A051B4995445974C0CF2FE5FF"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"gb","key":"open university milton keynes","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Open University Milton Keynes","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Science and Information Studies","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Science, Policy and Information Studies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mark Michael","key":"hallpau","last":"Hall","name":"Hall, Mark Michael","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Toine","key":"bogerspau","last":"Bogers","locid":"c39fa087-a00a-425e-9e0f-7fa301dbe554","name":"Bogers, Toine","orcid":"0000-0003-0716-676X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3343413.3377984","eisbn":["9781450368926"],"pages":"457-461","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery (ACM)","series":"CHIIR 2020 - Proceedings of the 2020 Conference on Human Information Interaction and Retrieval","status":"p","title":"CHIIR '20: Proceedings of the 2020 Conference on Human Information Interaction and Retrieval"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85082464589"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-a78a4923-bdd6-4327-9824-3bfe81b7de8e"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"A Standardised Format for Exchanging User Study Instruments","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-098647","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Over the past decade, recommendation algorithms for ratings prediction and item ranking have steadily matured. However, these state-of-the-art algorithms are typically applied in relatively straightforward and static scenarios: given information about a user's past item preferences in isolation, can we predict whether they will like a new item or rank all unseen items based on predicted interest? In reality, recommendation is often a more complex problem: the evaluation of a list of recommended items never takes place in a vacuum, and it is often a single step in the user's more complex background task or need. The goal of the ComplexRec 2019 workshop is to offer an interactive venue for discussing approaches to recommendation in complex scenarios that have no simple one-size-fits-all solution.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Koolen, Marijn","Mobasher, Bamshad","Bogers, Toine","Tuzhilin, Alexander"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-072740"],"event":{"acronym":"RecSys","end":"2019-09-20","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2019-09-20","title":"ComplexRec 2019: Third Workshop on Recommendation in Complex Scenarios","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","DePaul University","Humanities Cluster Royal Netherlands Academy of Arts and Sciences","New York University"],"keyword":["Complex recommendation"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"overview of the workshop on recommendation in complex scenarios 000000002019 complexrec 000000002019","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/330025528/overview.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-072740","identifier":[{"id":"85072896012","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-4e5459fa-961e-4c1a-8e4f-18d5c24fb66a"],"keyword":["complex recommendation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F609B78BAF9E00F1A3EB2FDA4169617E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/330025528/overview.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"nl","key":"humanities cluster royal netherlands academy of arts and sciences","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Humanities Cluster Royal Netherlands Academy of Arts and Sciences","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"depaul university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"DePaul University","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Science and Information Studies","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Science, Policy and Information Studies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"us","key":"new york university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"New York University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Marijn","key":"koolenpau","last":"Koolen","name":"Koolen, Marijn","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Bamshad","key":"mobasherpau","last":"Mobasher","name":"Mobasher, Bamshad","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau