{"abstract":"This paper describes our experiences with the interactive IR tracks organized at CLEF from 2013-2016 and aggregates the lessons learned with each consecutive instance of the lab. We end with a summary of practical insights and lessons for future collaborative interactive IR evaluation exercises and for potential re-use scenarios.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Petras, Vivien","Koolen, Marijn","Gäde, Maria","Bogers, Toine"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-100392"],"event":{"acronym":"CHIIR","end":"2019-03-14","place":"Glasgow, gb","start":"2019-03-14","title":"2019 CHIIR Workshop on Barriers to Interactive IR Resources Re-use, BIIRRR 2019","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany","Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Humboldt University of Berlin","Royal Netherlands Academy of Arts and Sciences"],"keyword":["Book search","CLEF","Evaluation","Information seeking","Interactive information retrieval","SBS"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"experiences with the 000000002013 000000002016 clef interactive information retrieval tracks","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/330025435/paper5_1_.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-100392","identifier":[{"id":"85063485494","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-ad87bf47-a781-4559-b937-4b240eb44e65"],"keyword":["Book search","CHiC","CLEF","Evaluation","Information seeking","Interactive information retrieval","SBS"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-D0D8C7D35DB9EC65D097CCC471D340D5"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://