{"abstract":"Over the past decade, recommendation algorithms for ratings prediction and item ranking have steadily matured. However, these state-of-the-art algorithms are typically applied in relatively straightforward scenarios. In reality, recommendation is often a more complex problem: it is usually just a single step in the user's more complex background need. These background needs can often place a variety of constraints on which recommendations are interesting to the user and when they are appropriate. However, relatively little research has been done on these complex recommendation scenarios. The ComplexRec 2018 workshop addresses this by providing an interactive venue for discussing approaches to recommendation in complex scenarios that have no simple one-size-fits-all solution.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Bogers, Toine","Koolen, Marijn","Mobasher, Bamshad","Said, Alan","Petersen, Casper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-054693"],"event":{"acronym":"RecSys","end":"2018-10-07","place":"Vancouver, ca","start":"2018-10-02","title":"RecSys 2018: 12th ACM Conference on Recommender Systems","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands","Sweden","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","DePaul University","Royal Netherlands Academy of Arts and Sciences","University of Skövde"],"keyword":["Complex recommendation","Query driven recommendation"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"000000000002nd workshop on recommendation in complex scenarios complexrec 000000002018","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85056774362&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-054693","identifier":[{"id":"85056774362","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-0fe729f2-693f-4966-9bd4-6dc57eaa6cf8"],"keyword":["Complex recommendation","Constraint-based recommendation","Context-aware recommendation","Feature-driven recommendation","Query-driven recommendation","Task-based recommendation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-059B9360338AB4EFDADC9283C6AF2C25"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Science and Information Studies","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Science, Policy and Information Studies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"nl","key":"royal netherlands academy of arts and sciences","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Royal Netherlands Academy of Arts and Sciences","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"depaul university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"DePaul University","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"se","key":"university of skövde","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Skövde","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Sampension"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Antonius Marinus","key":"bogerspau","last":"Bogers","locid":"c39fa087-a00a-425e-9e0f-7fa301dbe554","name":"Bogers, Toine","name_org":"Bogers, Antonius Marinus","orcid":"0000-0003-0716-676X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Marijn","key":"koolenpau","last":"Koolen","name":"Koolen, Marijn","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Bamshad","key":"mobasherpau","last":"Mobasher","name":"Mobasher, Bamshad","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Alan","key":"saidpau","last":"Said","name":"Said, Alan","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Casper","key":"petersenpau","last":"Petersen","name":"Petersen, Casper","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3240323.3240332","eisbn":["9781450359016"],"pages":"510-511","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery (ACM)","status":"p","title":"RecSys 2018 - 12th ACM Conference on Recommender Systems"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85056774362"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Universities","sampension"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-0fe729f2-693f-4966-9bd4-6dc57eaa6cf8"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"2nd workshop on recommendation in complex scenarios (ComplexreC 2018)","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-054693","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Social tagging is an information classification paradigm where the users themselves are given the power to describe and categorize content for their own purposes using tags. The popularity of social tagging, and the ease with which such tags can be generated, assigned, and collected, has sparked significant research interest in tags and their possible applications. One such application is tag-based recommendation: generating better recommendations by incorporating tags into the recommendation process. This chapter provides an overview of the state-of-the-art approaches to tag-based item recommendation, organised by the class of recommendation algorithms that is augmented with tags, such as collaborative filtering, dimensionality reduction, graph-based recommendation, content-based filtering, machine learning, and hybrid recommendation. The chapter also offers an overview of the most important methods for recommending which tags to apply to content. Finally, the chapter discusses the open research problems in tag-based recommendation and what would be needed to address them.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Bogers, Toine"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-718927"],"filters":{"added":"2024-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Collaborative filtering","Machine learning","Recommender systems","Social tagging","Tag recommendation","content based recommendation","hybrid recommendation","social bookmarking","tag based recommendation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"tag based recommendation","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85046777137","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-718927","identifier":[{"id":"85046777137","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-de35809d-ec9a-4371-ac8c-67a78de74d51"],"keyword":["collaborative filtering","content-based recommendation","hybrid recommendation","machine learning","recommender systems","social bookmarking","social tagging","tag recommendation","tag-based recommendation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-5-683E17C47AE133AA0A78B764BACA8701"],"org":[{"affno":1,"key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU"}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Toine","key":"bogerspau","last":"Bogers","locid":"e726f512-d3fd-4d89-962a-3aa9f532a52f","name":"Bogers, Toine","orcid":"0000-0003-0716-676X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-319-90092-6_12","issn":["03029743","16113349"],"issn_org":["03029743"],"journal":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","pages":"441-479","publisher":"Springer","status":"p","title":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science"},"review":"No Review","scoID":["2-s2.0-85046777137"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-de35809d-ec9a-4371-ac8c-67a78de74d51"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Tag-Based Recommendation","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-718927","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
