nd Information Studies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"nl","key":"royal netherlands academy of arts and sciences","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Royal Netherlands Academy of Arts and Sciences","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Toine","key":"bogerspau","last":"Bogers","locid":"c39fa087-a00a-425e-9e0f-7fa301dbe554","name":"Bogers, Toine","orcid":"0000-0003-0716-676X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Marijn","key":"koolenpau","last":"Koolen","name":"Koolen, Marijn","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["16130073"],"place":"Vancouver, Canada","publisher":"CEUR-WS","series":"CEUR Workshop Proceedings","status":"p","title":"KaRS 2018: Proceedings of the 2018 Knowledge-aware and Conversational Recommender Systems Workshop"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85066467057"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-ee824841-8c64-4fee-9a08-52ed5ed3e8bf"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"“I’m looking for something like …” : Combining Narratives and Example Items for Narrative-driven Book Recommendation","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-119381","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"This article reports on the CBRecSys 2016 workshop, the third edition of the workshop on New Trends in Content-based Recommender Systems, co-located with RecSys 2016 in Boston, MA. Content-based recommendation has been applied successfully in many different domains, but it has not seen the same level of attention as collaborative filtering techniques have. Nevertheless, there are many recommendation domains and applications where content and metadata play a key role, either in addition to or instead of ratings and implicit usage data. The CBRecSys workshop series provides a dedicated venue for work dedicated to all aspects of content-based recommender systems.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Bogers, Toine","Koolen, Marijn","Musto, Cataldo","Lops, Pasquale","Semeraro, Giovanni"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-061322"],"event":{"acronym":"RecSys","end":"2016-09-19","place":"Boston, MA, us","start":"2016-09-15","title":"RecSys 2016","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Italy","Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Amsterdam","University of Bologna","Università Degli Studi Di Bari Aldo Moro"],"keyword":["Complex recommendation"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"report on recsys 000000002016 workshop on new trends in content based recommender systems","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/295221609/p045.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-061322","ids":["aau-26d96be9-20c8-4c43-ac41-ad08226ef962"],"keyword":["complex recommendation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-