{"abstract":"The combination of structured information retrieval with user profile information represents the scenario where systems search with an explicit statement of the information need—a search query—as well as a profile of a user, which can contain information about previous interactions, search history, user demographics, or other relevant information about the user’s preferences. The relation between the profile and the information need is implicit and may contain many irrelevant signals. The task of the system then is to model both the current information need and the background user preferences to derive notions of topical relevance as well as user relevance and to find the right balance between these notions to determine the optimal ranking of search results.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Koolen, Marijn","Bogers, Toine"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-052284"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Royal Netherlands Academy of Arts and Sciences"],"keyword":["User profiling","XML retrieval"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"profiles and context for structured text retrieval","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dbp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-052284","ids":["aau-07c240cd-cb32-40ae-b735-952e2a516252"],"keyword":["XML retrieval","structured retrieval","user profiling"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-F0CE254A35BB210EBC4FAF7F3F393932"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"nl","key":"royal netherlands academy of arts and sciences","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Royal Netherlands Academy of Arts and Sciences","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Science and Information Studies","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Science, Policy and Information Studies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Marijn","key":"koolenpau","last":"Koolen","name":"Koolen, Marijn","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Toine","key":"bogerspau","last":"Bogers","locid":"c39fa087-a00a-425e-9e0f-7fa301dbe554","name":"Bogers, Toine","orcid":"0000-0003-0716-676X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-1-4899-7993-3_80726-1","eisbn":["9781489979933"],"isbn":["9781489979933"],"place":"New York, NY","publisher":"Springer","status":"p","title":"Encyclopedia of Database Systems"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-07c240cd-cb32-40ae-b735-952e2a516252"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Profiles and Context for Structured Text Retrieval","type":"Book Preface, Encycl. Entry","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-052284","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Over the course of the past two decades, the Interactive Tracks at TREC and INEX have contributed greatly to our knowledge of how to run an interactive IR evaluation campaign. In this position paper, we add to this body of knowledge by taking stock of our own experiences and challenges in organizing the CHIC and SBS Interactive Tracks from 2013 to 2016 in the form of a list of important properties of any future IIR evaluation campaigns.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Bogers, Toine","Gäde, Maria","Hall, Mark M.","Petras, Vivien","Skov, Mette"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-059513"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Edge Hill University","Humboldt University of Berlin"],"keyword":["Evaluation","Information seeking","Interactive IR"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"lessons learned from the chic and sbs interactive tracks a wishlist for interactive ir evaluation","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/268205933/OpenAccessArticle.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-059513","identifier":[{"id":"85019589657","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-206f2787-286e-4d48-8362-f20a713276d2"],"keyword":["Evaluation","Information seeking","Interactive IR"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-3FDCD6C51414217AF8181300BFBD1ADD"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"rem","url":"http://ceur-ws.org/Vol-1798/paper2.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"