{"abstract":"The goal of the SBS 2016 Suggestion Track is to evaluate approaches for supporting users in searching collections of books who express their information needs both in a query and through example books. The track investigates the complex nature of relevance in book search and the role of traditional and user-generated book metadata in retrieval. We consolidated last year’s investigation into the nature of book suggestions from the LibraryThing forums and how they compare to book relevance judgements. Participants were encouraged to incorporate rich user profiles of both topic creators and other LibraryThing users to explore the relative value of recommendation and retrieval paradigms for book search.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Koolen, Marijn","Bogers, Toine","Jaap, Kamps"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-055513"],"event":{"acronym":"CLEF","end":"2016-09-08","place":"Évora, pt","start":"2016-09-05","title":"Conference and Labs of the Evaluation forum","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Huygens Institute of Netherlands History","University of Amsterdam"],"keyword":["Book search","Information retrieval"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"overview of the sbs 000000002016 suggestion track","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/281622576/16091039.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-055513","identifier":[{"id":"85019586258","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-12c2ef83-923b-4bc7-956a-bc9c0bdb3b77"],"keyword":["book search","information retrieval"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":[