CLEF 2016 - Conference and Labs of the Evaluation Forum"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85019586258"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-12c2ef83-923b-4bc7-956a-bc9c0bdb3b77"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Overview of the SBS 2016 Suggestion Track","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-055513","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"This article reports on the CBRecSys 2015 workshop, the second edition of the workshop on new trends in content-based recommender systems, co-located with RecSys 2015 in Vienna, Austria. Content-based recommendation has been applied successfully in many different domains, but it has not seen the same level of attention as collaborative filtering techniques have. Nevertheless, there are many recommendation domains and applications where content and metadata play a key role, either in addition to or instead of ratings and implicit usage data. The CBRecSys workshop series provides a dedicated venue for work dedicated to all aspects of content-based recommender systems.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Bogers, Toine","Koolen, Marijn"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-071350"],"event":{"acronym":"RecSys","end":"2015-09-20","place":"Vienna, at","start":"2015-09-16","title":"RecSys 2015","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Huygens Institute of Netherlands History"],"keyword":["Recommender systems","content based recommender systems"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"report on recsys 000000002015 workshop on new trends in content based recommender systems cbrecsys 000000002015","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/246648641/cbrecsys2015_sigir_forum.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-071350","ids":["aau-4979e114-a23c-41ad-8af7-04c1279a49a7"],"keyword":["content-based recommender systems","recommender systems"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-D8295E28D68180A6B7E5F0C9F7B9DCCF"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/246648641/cbrecsys2015_sigir_forum.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Humanities (HUM)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Communication and Information Studies (CIS)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"nl","key":"huygens institute of netherlands history","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Huygens Institute of Netherlands History","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Toine","key":"bogerspau","last":"Bogers","locid":"c39fa087-a00a-425e-9e0f-7fa301dbe554","name":"Bogers, Toine","orcid":"0000-0003-0716-676X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Marijn","key":"koolenpau","last":"Koolen","name":"Koolen, Marijn","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/2888422.2888445","issn":["01635840","15580229"],"issn_org":["01635840"],"journal":"SIGIR Forum","pages":"141-146","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery (ACM)","status":"p","title":"SIGIR Forum"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-4979e114-a23c-41ad-8af7-04c1279a49a7"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Report on RecSys 2015 Workshop on New Trends in Content-Based Recommender Systems (CBRecSys 2015)","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-071350","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"While content-based recommendation has been applied successfully in many different domains, it has not seen the same level of attention as collaborative filtering techniques have. However, there are many recommendation domains and applications where content and metadata play a key role, either in addition to or instead of ratings and implicit usage data. For some domains, such as movies, the relationship between content and usage data has seen thorough investigation already, but for many other domains, such as books, news, scientific articles, and Web pages we still do not know if and how these data sources should be combined to provided the best recommendation performance. The CBRecSys 2016 workshop provides a dedicated venue for papers dedicated to all aspects of content-based recommendation.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Bogers, Toine","Koolen, Marijn","Musto, Cataldo","Lops, Pasquale","Semeraro, Giovanni"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-093039"],"event":{"acronym":"RecSys","end":"2016-09-19","place":"Boston, MA, us","start":"2016-09-15","title":"RecSys 2016","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Italy","Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Huygens Institute of Netherlands History","Università Degli Studi Di Bari Aldo Moro"],"keyword":["Recommender systems","content based recommendation"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"third workshop on new trends in content based recommender systems cbrecsys 000000002016","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/2959100.2959200","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-093039","identifier":[{"id":"84991212507","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-94488924-5b35-49df-b83c-0b021a392c9e"],"keyword":["content-based recommendation","recommender systems"],"lang":"English","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-0B6A9DABA9A99C60B700858224519B1E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/246647978/cbrecsys_2016_workshop.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/2959100.2959200","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Communication and Information Studies (CIS)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"nl","key":"huygens institute of netherlands history","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Huygens Institute of Netherlands History","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"it","key":"università degli studi di bari aldo moro","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Università Degli Studi Di Bari Aldo Moro","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Toine","key":"bogerspau","last":"Bogers","locid":"c39fa087-a00a-425e-9e0f-7fa301dbe554","name":"Bogers, Toine","orcid":"0000-0003-0716-676X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Marijn","key":"koolenpau","last":"Koolen","name":"Koolen, Marijn","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Cataldo","key":"mustopau","last":"Musto","name":"Musto, Cataldo","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Pasquale","key":"lopspau","last":"Lops","name":"Lops, Pasquale","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Giovanni","key":"semeraropau","last":"Semeraro","name":"Semeraro, Giovanni","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/2959100.2959200","eisbn":["9781450340359"],"pages":"419-420","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery (ACM)","status":"p","title":"RecSys ‘16: Proceedings of the 2015 ACM Conference on Recommender Systems"},"review":"Undetermined","scoID":["2-s2.0-84991212507"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-94488924-5b35-49df-b83c-0b021a392c9e"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Third Workshop on New Trends in Content-based Recommender Systems (CBRecSys 2016)","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-093039","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"While content-based recommendation has been applied successfully in many different domains, it has not seen the same level of attention as collaborative filtering techniques have. However, there are many recommendation domains and applications where content and metadata play a key role, either in addition to or instead of ratings and implicit usage data. For some domains, such as movies, the relationship between content and usage data has seen thorough investigation already, but for many other domains, such as books, news, scientific articles, and Web pages we still do not know if and how these data sources should be combined to provided the best recommendation performance. The CBRecSys 2015 workshop aims to address this by providing a dedicated venue for papers dedicated to all aspects of content-based recommendation.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Bogers, Toine","Koolen, Marijn"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-065975"],"event":{"acronym":"RecSys","end":"2015-09-20","place":"Vienna, at","start":"2015-09-16","title":"RecSys 2015","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Amsterdam"],"keyword":["Recommender systems","content based recommendation"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"second workshop on new trends in content based recommender systems cbrecsys 000000002015","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/222974390/recsys2015_workshop_camera_ready.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-065975","identifier":[{"id":"84962846986","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-36d194a2-580a-4ee0-8c21-14718f5789a2"],"keyword":["content-based recommendation","recommender systems"],"lang":"English","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D7CB469C7A4697C20C4FFC1DC08EF9B2"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/222974390/recsys2015_workshop_camera_ready.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Communication and Information Studies (CIS)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"nl","key":"university of amsterdam","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Amsterdam","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Toine","key":"bogerspau","last":"Bogers","locid":"c39fa087-a00a-425e-9e0f-7fa301dbe554","name":"Bogers, Toine","orcid":"0000-0003-0716-676X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Marijn","key":"koolenpau","last":"Koolen","name":"Koolen, Marijn","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/2792838.2798718","eisbn":["9781450336925"],"pages":"339-340","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery (ACM)","status":"p","title":"RecSys ‘15: Proceedings of the 2015 ACM Conference on Recommender Systems"},"review":"Undetermined","scoID":["2-s2.0-84962846986"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-36d194a2-580a-4ee0-8c21-14718f5789a2"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Second Workshop on New Trends in Content-based Recommender Systems (CBRecSys 2015)","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-065975","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"One of the determining factors of the quality of Web search engines is the size of their index. In addition to its influence on search result quality, the size of the indexed Web can also tell us something about which parts of the WWW are directly accessible to the everyday user. We propose a novel method of estimating the size of a Web search engine’s index by extrapolating from document frequencies of words observed in a large static corpus of Web pages. In addition, we provide a unique longitudinal perspective on the size of Google and Bing’s indexes over a nine-year period, from March 2006 until January 2015. We find that index size estimates of these two search engines tend to vary dramatically over time, with Google generally possessing a larger index than Bing. This result raises doubts about the reliability of previous one-off estimates of the size of the indexed Web. We find that much if not all of this variability can be explained by changes in the indexing and ranking infrastructure of Google and Bing. This casts further doubt on whether Web search engines can be used reliably for cross-sectional webometric studies.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Van den Bosch, Antal","Bogers, Toine","De Kunder, Maurice"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-080431"],"event":{"acronym":"ISSI","end":"2015-07-03","place":"Istanbul, tr","start":"2015-06-29","title":"15th International Society of Scientometrics and Informetrics Conference (ISSI 2015)","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","De Kunder Internet Media","Radboud University Nijmegen"],"keyword":["Bing","Google","Index size estimation","Indexing","Longitudinal study","Search engines","Webometrics","World Wide Web"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a longitudinal analysis of search engine index size","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.issi2015.org/files/downloads/all-papers/0071.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-080431","identifier":[{"id":"84991063615","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-6884c3fa-dfb3-412c-946e-52536bcc1aab"],"keyword":["Bing","Google","Surface Web","World Wide Web","index size estimation","indexing","longitudinal study","search engines","webometrics"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-C28C6588B966F69E61BB88CC555CCEDD"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.issi2015.org/files/downloads/all-papers/0071.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"nl","key":"radboud university nijmegen","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Radboud University Nijmegen","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Communication and Information Studies (CIS)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"nl","key":"de kunder internet media","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"De Kunder Internet Media","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Antal","key":"vandenboschantalpau","last":"Van den Bosch","name":"Van den Bosch, Antal","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk