{"abstract":"While content-based recommendation has been applied successfully in many different domains, it has not seen the same level of attention as collaborative filtering techniques have. However, there are many recommendation domains and applications where content and metadata play a key role, either in addition to or instead of ratings and implicit usage data. For some domains, such as movies, the relationship between content and usage data has seen thorough investigation already, but for many other domains, such as books, news, scientific articles, and Web pages we still do not know if and how these data sources should be combined to provided the best recommendation performance. The CBRecSys 2014 workshop aimed to address this by providing a dedicated venue for papers dedicated to all aspects of content-based recommender systems.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Bogers, Toine","Koolen, Marijn","Cantádor, Ivan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-068213"],"event":{"acronym":"RecSys","end":"2014-10-10","place":"Foster City, CA, us","start":"2014-10-06","title":"RecSys 2014","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands","Spain"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Universidad Autónoma de Madrid","University of Amsterdam"],"keyword":["Recommender systems","content based recommendation"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"report on recsys 000000002014 workshop on new trends in content based recommender systems cbrecsys 000000002014","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/222976213/p020.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-068213","ids":["aau-3eb489a0-3fd7-4767-be67-fab69c510e06"],"keyword":["content-based recommendation","recommender systems"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-5336463137F31B4FB7F2B97E7C6F41D7"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/222976213/p020.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://sigir.org/files/forum/2015J/p020.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Humanities (HUM)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Communication and Information Studies (CIS)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"nl","key":"university of amsterdam","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Amsterdam","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"es","key":"universidad autónoma de madrid","loc":["Spain","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Universidad Autónoma de Madrid","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Toine","key":"bogerspau","last":"Bogers","locid":"c39fa087-a00a-425e-9e0f-7fa301dbe554","name":"Bogers, Toine","orcid":"0000-0003-0716-676X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Marijn","key":"koolenpau","last":"Koolen","name":"Koolen, Marijn","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Ivan","key":"cantádorpau","last":"Cantádor","name":"Cantádor, Ivan","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["01635840","15580229"],"issn_org