{"abstract":"The Cultural Heritage in CLEF 2013 multilingual task comprised two sub-tasks: multilingual ad-hoc retrieval and semantic enrichment. The multilin-gual ad-hoc retrieval sub-task evaluated retrieval experiments in 13 languages (Dutch, English, German, Greek, Finnish, French, Hungarian, Italian; Norwe-gian, Polish, Slovenian, Spanish, Swedish). More than 140,000 documents were assessed for relevance on a tertiary scale. The ad-hoc task had 7 participants submitting 30 multilingual and 41 monolingual runs. The semantic enrichment task evaluated monolingual and multilingual semantic enrichments (suggestions based on a query) in the same 13 languages. Two participants submitted 10 runs. Results indicated that different languages contribute differently to the overall retrieval effectiveness, probably dependent on collection size. Experi-ments showed that using more or all of the provided languages usually increas-es retrieval effectiveness, but not always. For a multilingual task of this scale (13 languages), more participants are necessary in order to provide enough var-iations in runs to allow for comparative analyses.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Petras, Vivien","Bogers, Toine","Ferro, Nicola","Masiero, Ivano"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-069619"],"event":{"end":"2013-09-26","place":"Valencia, es","start":"2013-09-23","title":"2013 Cross Language Evaluation Forum Conference, CLEF 2013","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Petras, Vivien"],"country":["Germany","Italy"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Berlin School of Library and Information Science","University of Padua"],"keyword":["Ad hoc retrieval","Cultural heritage","Europeana","Multilingual retrieval","Semantic enrichment"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"cultural heritage in clef chic 000000002013 multilingual task overview","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=84922022079&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-069619","identifier":[{"id":"84922022079","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-439a08be-7413-4c99-bcb9-fbe7d57e3cc9"],"keyword":["Ad-hoc retrieval","Cultural heritage","Europeana","Multilingual retrieval","Semantic enrichment"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-17440BE4A043BB687E61BB570F0A4069"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"de","key":"berlin school of library and information science","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Berlin School of Library and Information Science","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Science, Policy and Information Studies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Kobenhavns Universitet"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"it","key":"university of padua","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Padua","used":