{"abstract":"In this paper, we describe our participation in the INEX 2013 Social Book Search track. We investigate the contribution of different types of document metadata, both social and controlled, as well as the contribution of the new 'query' topic representations. We find that the best results are obtained using all available document fields and topic representations.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Bogers, Toine","Larsen, Birger"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-120040"],"event":{"end":"2013-09-26","place":"Valencia, es","start":"2013-09-23","title":"2013 Cross Language Evaluation Forum Conference, CLEF 2013","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Book recommendation","Controlled metadata","Social tagging","XML retrieval"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"rslis at inex 000000002013 social book search track","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=84922022087&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-120040","identifier":[{"id":"84922022087","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-f0c3538d-bf63-43e1-b5c6-7c0a9cd6d358"],"keyword":["Book recommendation","Controlled metadata","Social tagging","XML retrieval"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-FF483AFB46472A391272F8480A854B72"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Science and Information Studies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Toine","key":"bogerspau","last":"Bogers","locid":"c39fa087-a00a-425e-9e0f-7fa301dbe554","name":"Bogers, Toine","orcid":"0000-0003-0716-676X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Birger","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"9cb12135-a825-43ba-87e2-b71651b91939","name":"Larsen, Birger","orcid":"0000-0002-3622-2698","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["16130073"],"journal":"CEUR Workshop Proceedings","publisher":"CEUR-WS","status":"p","title":"CEUR Workshop Proceedings","volume":"1179"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84922022087"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-f0c3538d-bf63-43e1-b5c6-7c0a9cd6d358"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"RSLIS at INEX 2013 : Social book search track","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-120040","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"While the phenomenon of serendipity has proven to be a popular research topic, the issue of how to measure it effectively still relatively unexplored. We present an exploratory study that contributes to our understanding of this issue by examining the effect of (1) priming people about the concept of serendipity and (2) monitoring participants on how they experience serendipity when searching for information in a controlled environment. Our experiments indicate that it is best to keep such controlled experiments as natural as possible: priming participants about serendipity and monitoring them during their experiments seem to have a negative influence on experiencing serendipity, as they are more likely to induce participants to stay on task instead of exhibiting diverging information behavior.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Bogers, Toine","Rasmussen, Rune Rosenborg","Jensen, Louis Sebastian Bo"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-545148"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Information behavior","Information retrieval","Measurement","Monitoring","Priming","Serendipity","quantitative data analysis"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Danish National Art Library"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"measuring serendipity in the lab the effects of priming and monitoring","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/47027013/Bogers_et_al._2013_Measuring_Serendipity_in_the_Lab_The_Effects_of_Priming_and_Monitoring_.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-545148","ids":["ku-fe3fbd3b-cb19-4d3c-93e9-8de761e8b29e"],"keyword":["information behavior","information retrieval","measurement","monitoring","priming","quantitative data analysis","serendipity"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-1631D3C089FCF07FA667C94A536E2ED3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://ideals.illinois.edu/handle/2142/42040","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/47027013/Bogers_et_al._2013_Measuring_Serendipity_in_the_Lab_The_Effects_of_Priming_and_Monitoring_.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.9776/13325","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Communication, Department of Information Studies (INF)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Danish National Art Library"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Toine","key":"bogerspau","last":"Bogers","locid":"1c118aa8-cea9-41c8-94dd-cba3065ee1be","name":"Bogers, Toine","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Rune Rosenborg","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, Rune Rosenborg","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Louis Sebastian Bo","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Louis Sebastian Bo","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.9776/13325","pages":"703-706","place":"IDEALS","publisher":"iSchools","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the iConference 2013"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-fe3fbd3b-cb19-4d3c-93e9-8de761e8b29e"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Measuring Serendipity in the Lab: The Effects of Priming and Monitoring","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-545148","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"CHAOS (Cultural Heritage Archive Open System) is a digital platform for Danish radio broadcasts. Radio broadcasts are an important and vibrant part of our cultural heritage, but providing efficient and effective access to such archives is challenging for lack of a solid digital infrastructure. The Danish LARM project aims to meet this challenge by making one million hours of radio programs available to humanities researchers through the digital platform CHAOS. CHAOS is being built in close cooperation with the researchers involved in LARM. In this paper, we present the user-driven development of the multi-tiered metadata scheme used in CHAOS.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Lykke, Marianne","Bogers, Toine","Larsen, Birger","Lund, Haakon"],"cuid":["S02-085.58-007757"],"event":{"acronym":"iConference","title":"iConference"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Cultural heritage","Digital Humanities","Information systems","Metadata","Radio"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"chaos user driven development of a metadata scheme for radio broadcast archives","src":["aau","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/202172521/Lund_et_al._2013_CHAOS_User_driven_Development_of_a_Metadata_Scheme_for_Radio_Broadcast_Archives_.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-085.58-007757","ids":["aau-a039f681-51d0-4b80-8b4a-f5f0d901fd7c","ku-2c6675d4-672c-48c3-8a57-ad5ff43c4aba"],"keyword":["cultural heritage","cultural informatics","digital humanities","information systems","metadata","radio","user-driven development"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["