{"abstract":"In this paper, we describe our participation in the INEX 2011 Social Book Search track. We investigate the contribution of different types of document metadata, both social and controlled, and examine the effectiveness of re-ranking retrieval results using social features. We find that the best results are obtained using all available document fields and topic representations.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Bogers, Toine","Christensen, Kirstine Wilfred","Larsen, Birger"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-472220"],"event":{"end":"2011-12-14","place":"Saarbrücken, de","start":"2011-12-12","title":"INEX 2011 workshop","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Book recommendation","Controlled metadata","Information retrieval","Recommender systems","Social tagging","XML retrieval"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["DBC"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"rslis at inex 000000002011 social book search track","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/47057150/inex2011.camera_ready.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-472220","ids":["ku-83a61b4a-d0d7-4873-ab3e-bb1642da5d2c"],"keyword":["XML retrieval","book recommendation","controlled metadata","information retrieval","recommender systems","social tagging"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-6B2D415F7121D2A7E6915365CF64F56F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/47057150/inex2011.camera_ready.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Communication, Department of Information Studies (INF)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["DBC"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Toine","key":"bogerspau","last":"Bogers","locid":"1c118aa8-cea9-41c8-94dd-cba3065ee1be","name":"Bogers, Toine","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Kirstine Wilfred","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Kirstine Wilfred","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Birger","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"3683438d-2cbb-4583-a99d-1b8ed50be5ce","name":"Larsen, Birger","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Shlomo","key":"gevapedh","last":"Geva","name":"Geva, Shlomo","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jaap","key":"kampspedh","last":"Kamps","name":"Kamps, Jaap","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Ralf","key":"schenkelpedh","last":"Schenkel","name":"Schenkel, Ralf","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"issn":["03029743"],"pages":"49-59","place":"Berlin, Heidelberg","publisher":"Springer Science+Business Media","series":"Lecture notes in computer science","status":"p","title":"INEX 2011: Proceedings of the 10th International Workshop of the Initiative for the Evaluation of XML Retrieval","volume":"7424"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84871550189"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-83a61b4a-d0d7-4873-ab3e-bb1642da5d2c"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"RSLIS at INEX 2011: Social Book Search Track","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-472220","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Integrated search is defined as searching across different document types and representations simultaneously, with the goal of presenting the user with a single ranked result list containing the optimal mix of document types. In this paper, we compare various approaches to integrating three different types of documents (bibliographic records for articles and books as well as full-text articles) using the iSearch collection: combining all document types in a single index, weighting the different document types using priors, and using collection fusion techniques to merge the retrieval results on three separate indexes corresponding to each of the document types. We find that a properly optimized retrieval model on a single combined index containing all documents without any special treatment performs no worse than our weighting and fusion methods, suggesting that more work is needed on alternative approaches to integrated search.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Sørensen, Diana Ransgaard","Bogers, Toine","Larsen, Birger"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-472541"],"event":{"end":"2012-04-01","place":"Barcelona, es","start":"2012-04-01","title":"TBAS 2012: ECIR Workshop on Task-based and Aggregated Search","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Data fusion","ISearch collection","Information retrieval"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"an exploration of retrieval enhancing methods for integrated search in a digital library","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/47072591/tbas2012_workshop_normal_size.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-472541","ids":["ku-842a1a6a-78ba-4856-ac1d-167ca7ef6ec3"],"keyword":["ISearch collection","collection fusion","data fusion","information retrieval","integrated search","prior weighting"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-C9E5C8144C4A1378DCD3B464CC9A3CB2"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://itlab.dbit.dk/~tbas2012/","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://itlab.dbit.dk/~tbas2012/files/ECIR2012-TBAS-Proceedings.pdf","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/47072591/tbas2012_workshop_normal_size.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Royal School of Library and Information Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Diana Ransgaard","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","name":"Sørensen, Diana Ransgaard","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Toine","key":"bogerspau","last":"Bogers","locid":"1c118aa8-cea9-41c8-94dd-cba3065ee1be","name":"Bogers, Toine","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Birger","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"3683438d-2cbb-4583-a99d-1b8ed50be5ce","name":"Larsen, Birger","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Birger","key":"larsenpedh","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Birger","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Christina","key":"liomapedh","last":"Lioma","name":"Lioma, Christina","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Arjen P.","key":"devriespedh","last":"de Vries","name":"de Vries, Arjen P.","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"pages":"4-8","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the ECIR 2012 Workshop on Task-Based and Aggregated Search (TBAS2012)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-842a1a6a-78ba-4856-ac1d-167ca7ef6ec3"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"An Exploration of Retrieval-Enhancing Methods for Integrated Search in a Digital Library","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-472541","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"In this paper, we describe our participation in the INEX 2012 Social Book Search track. We investigate the contribution of different types of document metadata, both social and controlled, and examine the effectiveness of re-ranking retrieval results using different social features, such as user ratings, tags, and authorship information. We find that the best results are obtained using all available document fields and topic representations. Reranking retrieval results works better on shorter topic representations, where there is less information for the retrieval algorithm to work with; longer topic representations do not benefit from our social re-ranking approaches.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Bogers, Toine","Larsen, Birger"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-067483"],"event":{"end":"2012-09-20","place":"Rome, it","start":"2012-09-17","title":"2012 Cross Language Evaluation Forum Conference, CLEF 2012","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Bogers, Toine"],"keyword":["Book recommendation","Controlled metadata","Re ranking","Social tagging","XML retrieval"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"rslis at inex 000000002012 social book search track","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=84922032277&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-067483","identifier":[{"id":"84922032277","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-3c298c0b-c268-49e6-a072-9195bf3c7e1a"],"keyword":["Book recommendation","Controlled metadata","Re-ranking","Social tagging","XML retrieval"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-29D9746D4889C193622EA3E76EFCC2E1"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Science and Information Studies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["The Royal School of Library and Information Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Toine","key":"bogerspau","last":"Bogers","locid":"c39fa087-a00a-425e-9e0f-7fa301dbe554","name":"Bogers, Toine","orcid":"0000-0003-0716-676X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Birger","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"9cb12135-a825-43ba-87e2-b71651b91939","name":"Larsen, Birger","orcid":"0000-0002-3622-2698","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["16130073"],"journal":"CEUR Workshop Proceedings","publisher":"CEUR-WS","status":"p","title":"CEUR Workshop Proceedings","volume":"1178"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84922032277"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-3c298c0b-c268-49e6-a072-9195bf3c7e1a"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"RSLIS at INEX 2012 : Social book search track","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-067483","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"The À Propos project was a joint research project between the CLST of Radboud University Nijmegen and the Tilburg center for Cognition and Communication from 2004 to 2008. The goal of the À Propos project was to support knowledge workers by suggesting relevant reading material during the writing process. A specific example of such support is identifying and recommending relevant scientific articles to researchers who are engaged in describing their own research.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Bogers, Toine","Van den Bosch, Antal"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-511122"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Radboud University Nijmegen"],"keyword":["Recommender systems","Social tagging","social bookmarking"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"onderzoekers die dit artikel lazen lazen ook","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/47062852/Bogers_et_al._2011_Onderzoekers_die_dit_artikel_lazen_lazen_ook..._.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-511122","ids":["ku-c538da6b-02d9-4938-a2d5-d9e9f166c310"],"keyword":["article recommendation","citeulike","recommender systems","social bookmarking","social reference managers","social tagging"],"lang":"Dutch","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D08FE7B82B963C3AD21C39A1C938D420"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/47062852/Bogers_et_al._2011_Onderzoekers_die_dit_artikel_lazen_lazen_ook..._.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Communication, Department of Information Studies (INF)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"nl","key":"radboud university nijmegen","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Radboud University Nijmegen","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Toine","key":"bogerspau","last":"Bogers","locid":"1c118aa8-cea9-41c8-94dd-cba3065ee1be","name":"Bogers, Toine","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Antal","key":"vandenboschpau","last":"Van den Bosch","name":"Van den Bosch, Antal","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issue":"December","journal":"DIXIT - Tijdschrift over taal- en spraaktechnologie","pages":"42","status":"p","title":"DIXIT - Tijdschrift over taal- en spraaktechnologie","volume":"8"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-c538da6b-02d9-4938-a2d5-d9e9f166c310"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Onderzoekers die dit artikel lazen, lazen ook...","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-511122","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Social bookmarking websites are rapidly growing in popularity. Recommender systems, a promising remedy to the information overload accompanying the explosive growth in content, are designed to identify which unseen content might be of interest to a particular user, based on his or her past preferences. Most previous work in recommendation for social bookmarking suffers from a lack of comparisons between the different available approaches. In this article, we address this issue by comparing and evaluating eight recommendation approaches on four data sets from two domains. We find that approaches that use tag overlap and metadata provide better results for social bookmarking data sets than the transaction patterns that are used traditionally in recommender systems research. In addition, we investigate how to fuse different recommendation approaches to further improve recommendation accuracy. We find that fusing recommendations can indeed produce significant improvements in recommendation accuracy. We also find that it is often better to combine approaches that use different data representations, such as tags and metadata, than to combine approaches that only vary in the algorithms they use. The best results are obtained when both of these aspects of the recommendation task are varied in the fusion process. Our findings can be used to improve the quality of recommendations not only on social bookmarking websites, but conceivably also on websites that offer annotated commercial content.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Bogers, Toine","van den Bosch, Antal"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-501049"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Tilburg University"],"keyword":["Collaborative filtering","Data fusion","Recommender systems","content based filtering","social bookmarking"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"fusing recommendations for social bookmarking websites","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/47064384/Fusing_Recommendations_for_Social_Bookmarking_Systems.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-501049","identifier":[{"id":"79955594290","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-b42c5bbe-8c71-4f14-b95c-8293c5da5b3e"],"keyword":["collaborative filtering","content-based filtering","data fusion","recommender systems","social bookmarking"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-74F2A4A4017A075A70543C84EA565194"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/47064384/Fusing_Recommendations_for_Social_Bookmarking_Systems.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.2753/JEC1086-4415150303","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Communication, Department of Information Studies (INF)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"nl","key":"tilburg university","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Tilburg University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Toine","key":"bogerspau","last":"Bogers","locid":"1c118aa8-cea9-41c8-94dd-cba3065ee1be","name":"Bogers, Toine","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Antal","key":"vandenboschpau","last":"van den Bosch","name":"van den Bosch, Antal","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.2753/jec1086-4415150303","issn":["10864415","15579301"],"issn_org":["10864415"],"issue":"3","journal":"International Journal of Electronic Commerce","pages":"31-72","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Electronic Commerce","volume":"15"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-b42c5bbe-8c71-4f14-b95c-8293c5da5b3e"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Fusing Recommendations for Social Bookmarking Websites","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-501049","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
